# Astro config ↔ content config

- **`astro.config.mjs`:** Sets `site`, Vite plugin **`@tailwindcss/vite`**, and the `@astrojs/sitemap` integration. Do not add integrations or npm features not reflected in `package.json`.
- **`src/content.config.ts`:** Adding/removing collections or changing Zod shapes requires coordinated updates to `src/pages/**` (every `getCollection("…")` consumer) and any layouts reading `frontmatter` / `entry.data`.
- **Site URL:** Changing `site` affects sitemap, RSS `context.site`, and canonical assumptions — update the placeholder SEO in `src/components/fundations/head/BaseHead.astro` when you productionize.
